\newlabel{fig:nadir-geometry}{{27}{73}{Roll/pitch geometry. A drone tilted at angle $\theta $ from vertical projects the optical axis forward by $\Delta _\mathrm {tilt} = h\tan \theta $. At \SI {35}{\metre } and $\theta = 10^{\circ }$, this displacement is \SI {6.2}{\metre }---larger than GPS receiver noise. During hover ($\theta < 1^{\circ }$), the displacement is $<$\SI {0.6}{\metre }}{figure.caption.133}{}}
