\newlabel{tab:static-vs-cooperative}{{61}{92}{Comparison of static camera estimation vs.\ cooperative vision-flight estimation. The cooperative system exploits the drone's ability to reposition, producing accuracy that improves over time rather than remaining fixed}{table.caption.193}{}}
